From cfc867ccfabd29c2ed586dbd906c0f07a5dc28e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dillon Varone <Dillon.Varone@amd.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Mar 2026 14:30:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07873/15333] drm/amd/display: Add DWB validation support to
 DML2.1 wrapper

[WHY&HOW]
DML2.1 wrapper was lacking translation for DWB. This change adds the
necessary translation for DWB validation and programming support.

Reviewed-by: Austin Zheng <austin.zheng@amd.com>
Signed-off-by: Dillon Varone <Dillon.Varone@amd.com>
Signed-off-by: Wayne Lin <wayne.lin@amd.com>
Tested-by: Dan Wheeler <daniel.wheeler@amd.com>
Signed-off-by: Alex Deucher <alexander.deucher@amd.com>
